messages "schpankay**To: danFwd:  poemCc: jimpaDate: Feb 19To: schpankaySubj: poemDate: Feb 18hey i sent you some stuff, well actually it's waiting for postage but anyway I wrote this after I sealed it and still thought that you might enjoy it.  It's a little rambling from a hack but I hope that will not ruin your enjoymentShe Walks in BeautyShe walks in beautySable tresses cascading her backSparkling eyes and an undying smileHer face's only clothingThese things don not neauty makeDaily meetings lessen her effect notHearts skip when she is sightsNearly die of happiness with a glanceEmbraces from this love, ecstasyThese are effects not the causeHer lips glisten in any lightFrom them magnificent phrases flowEnlighted words spring from herAided by a source hidden from sightEnchanted the ears of the listenerHer body full and sensuousAdorned with once normal garmentsMade divine by her touchFlesh peaks out teasingly brilliantThis the covering, ont the essenceDreams of Her cannot be banefulPerfection unattainable on earthHalf remembered in waking hoursParadise achieved in a dayHer impact remembered for agesThe body which pales Mona LisaThe mind which stuns Don GiovaniThis combination sheer perfectionHas captured my heart simply becauseShe walks in beauty.Have fun eh?**schpankay**To: danFwd:  poemDate: Feb 19To: schpankaySubj: poemDate: Feb 18hey i sent you some stuff, well actually it's waiting for postage but anyway I wrote this after I sealed it and still thought that you might enjoy it.  It's a little rambling from a hack but I hope that will not ruin your enjoymentShe Walks in BeautyShe walks in beautySable tresses cascading her backSparkling eyes and an undying smileHer face's only clothingThese things don not neauty makeDaily meetings lessen her effect notHearts skip when she is sightsNearly die of happiness with a glanceEmbraces from this love, ecstasyThese are effects not the causeH